# Render with: bash doc/record-example.sh doom-fire
Output doc/examples/doom-fire.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontFamily "DejaVu Sans Mono"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 560
Set Height 240
Set Padding 6
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set Framerate 22
Set WaitTimeout 180s

Hide
Type "bash doc/run-examples.sh doom-fire"
Enter
Wait+Screen /█/
Sleep 300ms
Show

Sleep 3s

Hide
Type "q"
Sleep 300ms
